ic> (ANKA clone) sporozoites and its relationship to protection by gamma-irradiated sporozoites</article-title><source>American Journal of Tropical Medicine and Hygiene</source><volume>42</volume><year>1990</year><fpage>309</fpage><lpage>313</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2184689</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="bib9"><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Janse</surname><given-names>C.J.</given-names></name><name><surname>Franke-Fayard</surname><given-names>B.</given-names></name><name><surname>Mair</surname><given-names>G.R.</given-names></name><name><surname>Ramesar</surname><given-names>J.</given-names></name><name><surname>Thiel</surname><given-names>C.</given-names></name><name><surname>Engelmann</surname><given-names>S.</given-names></name><name><surname>Matuschewski</surname><given-names>K.</given-names></name><name><surname>van Gemert</surname><given-names>G.J.</given-names></name><name><surname>Sauerwein</surname><given-names>R.W.</given-names></name><name><surname>Waters</surname><given-names>A.P.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>High efficiency transfection of <italic>Plasmodium berghei</italic> facilitates novel selection procedures</article-title><source>Molecular and Biochemical Parasitology</source><volume>145</volume><year>2006</year><fpage>60</fpage><lpage>70</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16242190</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="bib10"><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kadota</surname><given-names>K.</given-names></name><name><surname>Ishino</surname><given-names>T.</given-names></name><name><surname>Matsuyama</surname><given-names>T.</given-names></name><name><surname>Chinzei</surname><given-names>Y.</given-names></name><name><surname>Yuda</surname><given-names>M.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Essential role of membrane-attack protein in malarial transmission